{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 11 — `_variant-availability` private card-child block.

  NOT a stock Horizon block (stock has no per-variant availability on cards;
  its product-inventory block is PDP-only). Byte-faithful port of live Dawn's
  card availability strip, snippets/variant-availability.liquid (16L):
  loop product.variants, skip 'Default Title', show option2 else option1
  (size when Color/Size, else the single option), unavailable values struck
  through at 0.3 opacity; product types Yarn Skein / Pattern / Repair render
  nothing. That snippet stays untouched (live cards still consume it).

  Deviations from the Dawn source:
  - Own .hz-variant-availability* classes + own stylesheet mirroring
    component-card.css:631-640's computed values (12px / 4px gap / 0.3
    strike) — Dawn's component-card.css only loads on pages that render
    card-product, so hz surfaces can't rely on it.
  - A visually-hidden "Sold out" is appended to unavailable values (the
    strike-through is color-only information in the Dawn source).
  - Dawn's second render site (the >=1100px hover popup-overlay, gated on
    the native grid's enable_overlay setting) is a collection-grid feature —
    deferred to a future main-collection port, not this block.

  NOT in any default card preset: live Dawn featured-collection cards don't
  show the strip (it's collection-grid-only there; replace-posture parity).
  Allowlisted in _product-card / product-card / _product-card-group for
  per-instance opt-in.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign product = closest.product %}

{% unless product == blank %}
  {% unless product.type == 'Yarn Skein' or product.type == 'Pattern' or product.type == 'Repair' %}
    <div class="hz-variant-availability" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {% for variant in product.variants %}
        {% if variant.option1 == 'Default Title' %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
        <span class="{% unless variant.available %}hz-variant-availability__value--unavailable{% endunless %}">
          {% if variant.option2 %}{{ variant.option2 }}{% else %}{{ variant.option1 }}{% endif %}
          {%- unless variant.available -%}
            <span class="visually-hidden"> Sold out</span>
          {%- endunless -%}
        </span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% endunless %}
{% endunless %}

{% stylesheet %}
  .hz-variant-availability {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hz-variant-availability span {
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .hz-variant-availability .hz-variant-availability__value--unavailable {
    opacity: 0.3;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    cursor: default;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Variant availability",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Lists parent product variants, striking through sold-out ones. Hidden for Yarn Skein, Pattern, and Repair products."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Variant availability",
      "category": "Product"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
